# Imports

- Group imports in curly braces, e.g. `use std::{collections::HashMap, io::Result};`.
- Group imports into paragraphs by category with an empty line between each paragraph:
  1. Standard library (`std`)
  2. External crates (third-party dependencies from crates.io)
  3. Internal (workspace packages, including `crate` and other members like `common`)
